# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF. Git decides what counts as
# text; the exceptions below correct it where the heuristic is wrong or where
# the bytes are not ours to rewrite.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored PDFWriter sources keep the line endings they ship with upstream, so
# that diffs against a new upstream drop stay readable.
packages/native-with-source/src/deps/** -text

# PDF fixtures are binary: an xref table stores byte offsets into the file, so
# rewriting line endings corrupts the document. Git's heuristic misreads the
# ones with no NUL byte near the start, so mark them explicitly. Fonts and
# images are detected correctly and need no entry.
*.pdf binary
*.PDF binary
